### Delete product — valid seller owns the product (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/{id}
Authorization: Bearer SELLER_TOKEN_HERE

### Delete product — wrong seller token (expect 404 — ownership check)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/{id}
Authorization: Bearer ANOTHER_SELLER_TOKEN_HERE

### Delete product — no token (expect 401)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/{id}

### Delete product — product does not exist (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/000000000000000000000000
Authorization: Bearer SELLER_TOKEN_HERE

### Delete product — CLIENT role (expect 403)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/{id}
Authorization: Bearer CLIENT_TOKEN_HERE

### Verify deletion — should return 404 after deleting
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/{id}
